&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Step 1: Submit your resume and responses to our application questions in full&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
