&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Please note that your first day of work must be in-person at one of our office locations to complete onboarding documents and meet with some members of our team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
